<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Happy Anniversary, My Love!</title>
  <link href="style.css" rel="stylesheet" />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Press+Start+2P&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <h1>You're my smile. Always.</h1>
    <p class="nickname">Happy Anniversary, Dylan ❤️</p>
    <p class="subtext">To: My love, mi amor, baby</p>
  </header>

  <section id="gallery">
    <h2>📸 Our Adventures</h2>
    <div class="photos">
      <!-- Replace these with your own image links -->
      <img src="images/photo1.jpg" alt="Us 1" />
      <img src="images/photo2.jpg" alt="Us 2" />
      <img src="images/photo3.jpg" alt="Us 3" />
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="letter">
    <h2>💌 A Love Letter</h2>
    <p>
      Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, this is where you'll pour your heart out, write your love letter to Dylan, and say everything you've wanted to say. 💖
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="timeline">
    <h2>⏳ Our Timeline</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Day 1:</strong> We met</li>
      <li><strong>Day 14:</strong> First time we stayed up way too late talking</li>
      <li><strong>Day 50:</strong> You made me laugh until I cried</li>
      <li><strong>Day 100:</strong> Built our world together, block by block</li>
      <!-- Add your own milestones -->
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section id="music">
    <h2>🎶 Our Soundtrack</h2>
    <!-- Spotify playlist embed (replace with your link) -->
    <iframe style="border-radius:12px" src="https://open.spotify.com/embed/playlist/your_playlist_id" width="100%" height="152" frameBorder="0" allowfullscreen allow="autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; fullscreen; picture-in-picture" loading="lazy"></iframe>

    <!-- Undertale Home - background audio -->
    <audio autoplay loop controls hidden>
      <source src="home.mp3" type="audio/mpeg" />
      Your browser does not support the audio element.
    </audio>
  </section>

  <footer>
    <p>Made with ❤️ and red roses with thorns 🌹</p>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
